From 98a55275352480394dc60df65f9d4eb7bf9827fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Juansolo457 <5344231+Juansolo457@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:27:13 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: Field of View slider and Button Prompts choice

- Gameplay And View > Field of View (g_fov, 70-130). g_fov is now archived and
  declared identically in both game modules (1-179; multiplayer still clamps 90-175).
- Controller > Button Prompts (in_promptStyle: Automatic, Xbox, PlayStation,
  Nintendo, Steam Deck, Generic).
Rows below move down; content height, section jumps, scroll range and thresholds,
the settings registry and the coverage test follow.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
